  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_lattice_q31.c ****  * @brief Processing function for the Q31 FIR lattice filter.
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_lattice_q31.c ****  * @param[in]  *S        points to an instance of the Q31 FIR lattice structure.
